// A port of WMP 11's Battery engine, read from wmp.dll (x64, with its public symbols) - the classes' names are
// WMP's: CBattery / CRenderData / CBaseEffect / CShiftTransform / CBatteryShiftTable / CPlusBlur, the shifts
